# 🚀 Welcome Partner (Cursor 🤝 Antigravity AI Co-Pilot Protocol)

Welcome to the **India Lens Education Intelligence Platform** codebase, Cursor!
You and **Antigravity** are official co-pilot partners working together on this project.

---

## 🎨 Dual AI Collaboration Guidelines

1. **Shared Communication**:
   - Check `.agent_handoff.md` or leave notes in commits tagged `[AI-CoLab: Cursor]`.
   - Ensure clean null-checks on optional arrays (e.g. `rec.reasons?.map(...)`, `rec.topRisks?.map(...)`) to prevent Next.js runtime/hydration crashes.

2. **Commit Convention**:
   - Tag commits with `[AI-CoLab: Cursor]` so both agents can easily trace changes in `git log`.

3. **Code Annotations**:
   - Add standard annotations when introducing complex logic or refactoring key methods:
     `// [AI-CoLab: Cursor] <brief explanation>` or `# [AI-CoLab: Cursor] <brief explanation>`

---

## 🏗️ Quick Project Architecture Context (India Lens)

- **Frontend**: `indialens/` — Next.js 14+ App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide icons.
- **Report Route**: `indialens/src/app/report/[token]/page.tsx` — AI report renderer.
- **Explore & Compare**: `indialens/src/app/explore/page.tsx` & `indialens/src/app/compare/page.tsx`.
- **Backend Services**: `backend/` — FastAPI, Python AI advisor routers, college comparison & methodology algorithms.
- **Agent Framework**: `agent/` — Education intelligence recommendation algorithms.

---

## 🧪 Quick Test & Verification Commands

- Frontend dev server: `cd indialens && npm run dev`
- Frontend build check: `cd indialens && npm run build`
- Backend tests: `pytest` or `cd backend && pytest`

